%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 5a584a25f7a2f6c23a420ed9d0c79f73, type: 3}
  m_Name: npc_linn
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::AthenHill.NpcDefinition
  id: npc_linn
  displayName: Linn
  role: Elder of the hill
  entries:
  - node: again
    requires: "flag:linn_met"
  nodes:
  - id: greeting
    title: "Elder of the hill"
    text: "Sit, before the sun finishes you. New people always stare at the walls. Look at the tree instead. Everything Ward has ever bled for is down under those roots."
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: cf75b54e0d214dd6ad778263acc75723, type: 3}
    choices:
    - id: tree
      label: "What's under the tree?"
      next: "hill"
      action: 
      requires: 
      setFlag: "linn_met"
    - id: housing
      label: "Is there anywhere in Ward I could stay?"
      next: "housing"
      action: 
      requires: "primer, !flag:home_leased"
      setFlag: "home_asked"
    - id: leave
      label: "Another time, Linn."
      next: 
      action: "close"
      requires: 
      setFlag: "linn_met"
  - id: again
    title: "Elder of the hill"
    text: "Still breathing? Good. Sit. Old women and old cities both like to be asked about themselves."
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 890b4ba214044ab58477463e95b666fc, type: 3}
    choices:
    - id: tree
      label: "Tell me about Ward."
      next: "hill"
      action: 
      requires: 
      setFlag: 
    - id: housing
      label: "Is there anywhere in Ward I could stay?"
      next: "housing"
      action: 
      requires: "primer, !flag:home_leased"
      setFlag: "home_asked"
    - id: leave
      label: "Just passing, Linn."
      next: 
      action: "close"
      requires: 
      setFlag: "linn_met"
  - id: hill
    title: "The oasis"
    text: "Water. The only sure well for hundreds of kilometres. The company built here for the ore, back when Tir was a line in somebody's accounts. They dug it, shaped it, shipped it off-world. Then one season, the ships didn't come."
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4a0d8d8ea8974efb9f56c5a66b1bf62e, type: 3}
    choices:
    - id: fall
      label: "What happened when they stopped?"
      next: "fall"
      action: 
      requires: 
      setFlag: 
    - id: wardens
      label: "Who guards the water now?"
      next: "wardens"
      action: 
      requires: 
      setFlag: 
    - id: back
      label: "Let me ask you something else."
      next: "again"
      action: 
      requires: 
      setFlag: 
  - id: fall
    title: "The Fall"
    text: "Nobody told the machines. Some kept digging for masters long dead. Others decided we were in the way, or that we were ore. The cities went dark, one, then the next, then all of them. That's what we call the Fall."
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 755a67f5bdb44bcda589f2745e9fe8ec, type: 3}
    choices:
    - id: silence
      label: "Why did no one come back for you?"
      next: "silence"
      action: 
      requires: 
      setFlag: 
    - id: rebuild
      label: "How did Ward survive?"
      next: "rebuild"
      action: 
      requires: 
      setFlag: 
    - id: back
      label: "Let me ask you something else."
      next: "again"
      action: 
      requires: 
      setFlag: 
  - id: silence
    title: "The silence"
    text: "They forgot us. They fenced us off for fear of the machines. Or they had it worse. I've heard all three sworn as truth, and never by anyone who'd know. The women of my family set out a cup for the supply pilot. It has been dry for centuries, and I still wash it."
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 59798b3c6fe74ff4ba78577be903e330, type: 3}
    choices:
    - id: rebuild
      label: "And Ward carried on without them."
      next: "rebuild"
      action: 
      requires: 
      setFlag: 
    - id: back
      label: "Let me ask you something else."
      next: "again"
      action: 
      requires: 
      setFlag: 
  - id: rebuild
    title: "The Great Rebuild"
    text: "Out of spite, mostly. One greenhouse, one nanofab, a few machines that stayed loyal. Then we woke the Quantum Tubes. Goods pulled to dust here and knitted whole at the far end. After that, dead nodes began waking on their own. Ask an engineer why, and watch them change the subject."
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d7a27b54f3744ce997dde858d8a1c401, type: 3}
    choices:
    - id: karaveen
      label: "What carried goods before the Tubes?"
      next: "karaveen"
      action: 
      requires: 
      setFlag: 
    - id: wardens
      label: "Who held the walls?"
      next: "wardens"
      action: 
      requires: 
      setFlag: 
    - id: back
      label: "Let me ask you something else."
      next: "again"
      action: 
      requires: 
      setFlag: 
  - id: karaveen
    title: "The Karaveen"
    text: "The Karaveen. When the cities fell they took to the sand, and for a lifetime they were the only thread between one well and the next. The Tubes made them needless. Still they go. There are people out there no Tube will ever reach, and the Karaveen know their children's names."
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 04bec88749fb49d2955bd48d064ccdaf, type: 3}
    choices:
    - id: berms
      label: "What's out there?"
      next: "berms"
      action: 
      requires: 
      setFlag: 
    - id: back
      label: "Let me ask you something else."
      next: "again"
      action: 
      requires: 
      setFlag: 
  - id: wardens
    title: "The Wardens"
    text: "The Wardens. They began as neighbours taking turns on the wall. Now some have more lattice in them than bone, and scraps of old machine minds to steady the gun. I've washed three of them for burial. They are the wall that has never been allowed to fall."
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d69ebc3f850e402fb17902dc8e46d9e0, type: 3}
    choices:
    - id: berms
      label: "What are they holding back?"
      next: "berms"
      action: 
      requires: 
      setFlag: 
    - id: rebuild
      label: "How did it all start again?"
      next: "rebuild"
      action: 
      requires: 
      setFlag: 
    - id: back
      label: "Let me ask you something else."
      next: "again"
      action: 
      requires: 
      setFlag: 
  - id: berms
    title: "The Outer Berms"
    text: "The Outer Berms. Factories to the horizon, once. Now it's their bones, and whatever still walks about inside them. There are secrets under that scrap. Few go looking, and fewer come home. So don't go out in just a shirt. Mira sells a vest and boots. Better plate, you build."
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 615ac114409f4984bd2c38288a6937f1, type: 3}
    choices:
    - id: ready
      label: "I'll remember that."
      next: 
      action: "close"
      requires: 
      setFlag: "linn_met"
    - id: back
      label: "Let me ask you something else."
      next: "again"
      action: 
      requires: 
      setFlag: 
  - id: housing
    title: "The housing roll"
    text: "There's a red container on the south wall, behind the Nanofab yard. The family left with a Karaveen caravan and made the bunk before they went. That's how you know they won't be back. Forty credits, and I write your name on the roll. In Ward that's worth more than the key. It means somebody counts you."
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d57531eb858c2da049d2d2c03bae580e, type: 3}
    choices:
    - id: lease
      label: "I'll take the lease (40 credits)."
      next: "housing_leased"
      action: "lease_home"
      requires: 
      setFlag: 
    - id: later
      label: "Not yet. I'll come back."
      next: 
      action: "close"
      requires: 
      setFlag: "linn_met"
  - id: housing_leased
    title: "The housing roll"
    text: "There. Written. The door knows you now, and so does the city. If some night you don't come home, someone will notice. Out here, that's most of what a home is."
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 140e804c09064085985a22d3ca00d32f, type: 3}
    choices:
    - id: leave
      label: "Thank you, Linn."
      next: 
      action: "close"
      requires: 
      setFlag: "linn_met"
  shop:
    title: Basic General
    subtitle: "Mira \xB7 Supplies, parts and salvage"
    supplies: 1
    parts: 1
    salvage: 1
    stockTags: []
    excludeTags: []
    magazines: 0
